                            <comment id="15143659" author="vkulichenko" created="Thu, 11 Feb 2016 22:56:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Anton,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I looked at your changes. It seems to me that the test does not completely verify the scenario when the query is executed from the client. After you stopped this client (line 176), you should start one more server and make sure that the remote filter is deployed there. Now this is not happening.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Otherwise looks good, assuming that all tests pass on TC.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
